# A research request answered from a live page: kiln fetches the release
# notes with web_fetch (shown as "web fetch") and answers with the link.
# (web_search is Anthropic's server tool, so it exists only on Anthropic
# models; web_fetch works with any provider.)
@real
@size 140x45
WAITFOR /describe a task/ 30
SHOT ready
TURN Look up the Go 1.23 release notes and summarize what range-over-func iterators are, with a link to the release notes.
SHOT answered
EXPECT /web fetch/
EXPECT /go\.dev\/doc\/go1\.23/
EXPECT /iter/
